{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17293","headline":"送商州杜中丞赴任 · 权德舆","name":"送商州杜中丞赴任","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"安康地里接商於，帝命专城总赋舆。\n夕拜忽辞青琐闼，晨装独捧紫泥书。\n深山古驿分驺骑，芳草闲云逐隼旟。\n绮皓清风千古在，因君一爲谢岩居。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17293.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17293","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}